  "description": "Timberjack SLX 27.5+ is a trail hardtail with the versatility for many off-road adventures. The aluminum frame is stiff, durable, and designed with progressive trail geometry for descending prowess and climbing capability. The 130 mm RockShox 35 Silver TK fork soaks up the trail hits to keep you in control through technical sections. Timberjack’s on-bike storage features let you bolt and strap your ride essentials straight to the frame for that oh-so-nice pack-free feeling. Our Alternator 2.0 dropouts easily adapt to different drivetrain choices and desired ride characteristics. The 27.5 x 2.8\" wheel and tire combo spins up quickly and corners nimbly with loads of grip for loose trails and slickrock sections. The Shimano SLX 1 x 12 components are a reliable, value-packed setup.",
